2,Indigenous music of Australia - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indigenous_music_of_Australia,"1 week ago - The traditional forms include many aspects of performance and musical instrumentation that are unique to particular regions or Aboriginal Australian groups; and some elements of musical tradition are common or widespread through much of the Australian continent, and even beyond.",Warungu,Australian
3,Warumpi Band - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warumpi_Band,"May 19, 2026 - In 1985 the band signed with Midnight Oil's Powderworks label and released their debut album, Big Name, No Blankets in April 1985. Australian rock music historian, Ian McFarlane, felt although ""[g]rounded in early American R&B and boogie as it was, the album was nevertheless an honest, enduring ...",Warungu,Australian
